Note: OpenSSH 10.2+ emits a warning banner to the user when the
negotiated KEX is not hybrid-PQ. By 2028, classical-only KEX is
expected to be disabled in the default SSH server configuration.

RESULT: PASS - client and server derived the same KEX secret.
